sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant ReactUI as React Frontend
    participant DRF as Django REST API
    participant DB as SQLite Database
    
    Student->>ReactUI: Fill Poster Submission Form
    ReactUI->>DRF: POST /api/posters/
    DRF->>DRF: Validate Data (Serializer)
    DRF->>DB: Save Poster Record
    DB-->>DRF: Success
    DRF-->>ReactUI: 201 Created (Poster details)
    ReactUI-->>Student: Show Success Message
